<link rel="stylesheet" href="legal.css"></head><body><main><p><a class="back" href="./">← Back to the map</a></p><h1>Terms &amp; Conditions</h1><p class="meta">Bharat Bhramanam · effective 29 September 2026</p><p class="todo">Owner details marked [LIKE THIS] still need to be filled in before payments are switched on.</p><div class="card">
<p>These terms apply to the Bharat Bhramanam website and app ("the Service"), operated by [OWNER FULL LEGAL NAME] ("we", "us"). By creating an account or paying, you agree to them.</p>
<h2>1. The Service</h2><p>An interactive travel map of India with place information, trip-planning tools and optional Premium features. Travel information (permits, closures, prices, weather, road estimates) is provided in good faith for planning only. It may be incomplete or out of date. Always confirm with official sources before you travel. We are not a travel agent and do not book tickets, stays or permits.</p>
<h2>2. Accounts</h2><p>You need a valid email address to create an account. Keep your password secret; you are responsible for activity on your account. One account is for one person; sharing or reselling access is not allowed.</p>
<h2>3. Premium and payment</h2><p>Premium costs ₹499 as a one-time payment for lifetime access to the Premium features of the current Service, for as long as the Service is operated. Payments are processed by Razorpay; we never see or store your card, UPI or bank details.</p>
<h2>4. Refunds</h2><p>See the <a href="refund.html">Refunds &amp; Cancellation policy</a>.</p>
<h2>5. Acceptable use</h2><p>Do not attempt to break security, scrape the Service in bulk, bypass payment, or upload unlawful content. We may suspend accounts that do.</p>
<h2>6. Content and credits</h2><p>Map boundaries follow the Survey of India depiction (DataMeet). Relief and rivers come from Natural Earth. Place photos come from Wikimedia Commons contributors under free licences and are credited on each photo. Photos you upload stay on your own device.</p>
<h2>7. Liability</h2><p>The Service is provided "as is". To the extent the law allows, our total liability is limited to the amount you paid us. We are not liable for travel losses, delays, injuries or decisions made using the Service.</p>
<h2>8. Changes and law</h2><p>We may update these terms and will post the new date here. These terms are governed by the laws of India, and courts at [CITY FOR COURTS, e.g. Raipur] have jurisdiction.</p>
<h2>9. Contact</h2><p>[SUPPORT EMAIL] · [CONTACT PHONE NUMBER]</p></div><footer><a href="terms.html">Terms</a> · <a href="privacy.html">Privacy</a> · <a href="refund.html">Refunds &amp; cancellation</a> · <a href="shipping.html">Shipping &amp; delivery</a> · <a href="pricing.html">Pricing</a> · <a href="contact.html">Contact</a></footer></main></body></html>